Package: duckdb
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: coplo <dayearnew@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://duckdb.org/
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Description: In-process analytical SQL database CLI
 DuckDB is an in-process analytical database system. This package provides
 the official DuckDB command-line interface from the upstream Linux release.
